	(text "Power input is +3.3V or USB. We either take the 3.3V input or produce\n3.3V from VBUS. From that, we generate 0.85-0.95 for the FPGA core, and \n1.8V for the FPGA and MCU. In the frontend schematic, LDOs generate a\n2.85V analog and digital supply for the frontend IC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 53.594 19.558 0)
